The detection logic in dist/promptlanx-hook.js (source: src/engine/ in this repository) is
adapted from the PromptLanx detection engine. Copied and adapted parts: the API-key and secret
detector specifications, the configurable key-format builder and its settings validation, the
regex detector runtime with its time budget, and the spec parser.

dist/promptlanx-hook.js has no third-party runtime dependencies. It is bundled with esbuild,
which is used at build time only and is not included in the output.
